    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Soap.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built on old-school FPS roots, <i>Soap</i> is a brutal movement platformer where only the sharpest runs survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/147e9a1887f3f37afa12fbe15f50b993.poster.avif?t=1752831989\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/147e9a1887f3f37afa12fbe15f50b993.webm?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/147e9a1887f3f37afa12fbe15f50b993.mp4?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall-jump, strafe, and slide your way through punishing levels designed to push your mechanics to the limit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboards don't lie \u2014 your time is either clean or it's trash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hone your skills. Shave down your time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/ed3a3d60493060b47ae4055830afc970.poster.avif?t=1752831989\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/ed3a3d60493060b47ae4055830afc970.webm?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/ed3a3d60493060b47ae4055830afc970.mp4?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 maps. 5 tracks. Every season.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locate and hit the Golden Record on each map to finish the level.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No excuses. Just get faster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/7dd74860c6c9d9437b0e057a3c0d0d93.poster.avif?t=1752831989\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/7dd74860c6c9d9437b0e057a3c0d0d93.webm?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/7dd74860c6c9d9437b0e057a3c0d0d93.mp4?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Soap.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built on old-school FPS roots, <i>Soap</i> is a brutal movement platformer where only the sharpest runs survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/147e9a1887f3f37afa12fbe15f50b993.poster.avif?t=1752831989\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/147e9a1887f3f37afa12fbe15f50b993.webm?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/147e9a1887f3f37afa12fbe15f50b993.mp4?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall-jump, strafe, and slide your way through punishing levels designed to push your mechanics to the limit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboards don't lie \u2014 your time is either clean or it's trash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hone your skills. Shave down your time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/ed3a3d60493060b47ae4055830afc970.poster.avif?t=1752831989\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/ed3a3d60493060b47ae4055830afc970.webm?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/ed3a3d60493060b47ae4055830afc970.mp4?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 maps. 5 tracks. Every season.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locate and hit the Golden Record on each map to finish the level.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No excuses. Just get faster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/7dd74860c6c9d9437b0e057a3c0d0d93.poster.avif?t=1752831989\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/7dd74860c6c9d9437b0e057a3c0d0d93.webm?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/7dd74860c6c9d9437b0e057a3c0d0d93.mp4?t=1752831989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
